{
  "scoring_tier": "result_level_compare",
  "scoring_justification": "The agent runs full DFT, phonon and magnetic supercell calculations and reports final properties. Recomputing those properties from raw charge densities/displacements is infeasible in the lightweight verifier; comparing the agent's reported values against the paper's reported results with tolerances is the strongest feasible tier.",
