      "source_provenance": "Paper Table I and main text (doi:10.1063/1.4921096): lattice constant 3.47 Å, bond lengths 2.45/2.84 Å, angle 90.15°, magnetic moment 4 μB, Bader charges -1.20/0.60 e, cohesive energy 2.64 eV/atom; PBE minority gap ~4.4 eV; Raman-active modes at 130, 179, 237 cm⁻¹, IR-active at 279 cm⁻¹; FM-AFM energy difference 93 meV/primitive cell, J=0.97 meV, Curie temperature 17 K.",
      "generation_method": "Extracted from the authoritative paper (markdown provided in the task context) and verified against the reference solve.sh which hardcodes the same numbers.",
      "why_not_fabricated": "All values are direct quotes from the published paper, checked for consistency between text and table; the reference solver reproduces them exactly."
    }
  ],
